# CANNON shell: a light charge lobbed by a Cannon (NpcSystem::fireCannonShell sets its team and launch velocity). On ANY
# contact it damages EVERY enemy-team unit within SplashRadius of the impact (GameProjectileComponent::onContact), then
# despawns. SplashEdge: the full UnitDamage at the centre, falling linearly to 15 % of it at the edge. HitsShadows: it is light, so a SHADOW (a demon that is not solid) takes its damage too. ImpactPuff: the
# impact bursts (Effects/shell_blast.pfx, made by GameMatch), on every role. MuzzleFlash: its launch flashes where it
# starts, 1 m ahead of the barrel's mouth (muzzle_flash.pfx, muzzle_smoke.pfx and a short point light), on every role.
# The crystal glows far over the bloom threshold (Emissive 15.9: the cap, it is stored in sixteenths - Scene.md
# "Emissive"), so the bloom puts a halo around it in flight.
# Its own POINT LIGHT (Component Light): a cyan glow that lights the ground and the walls under its flight. It flies
# 5 - 10 m up and the light falls off with the square of the distance, so it is a tenth as bright as the impact's light. It
# sits at the crystal's centre and casts ray-traced shadows (walls, buildings): the crystal itself is out of ray tracing
# (an emissive tint, Scene.md "Emissive"), so it does not block its own light. No field of its own. FieldDeflect: a
# demon's bubble (the Bulwark's, the Aegis', the Titan's) bends its flight sideways out of it, a little (m/s^2 at full
# depth). DeflectDrain: bending it costs that demon's battery (energy/s x the depth). Replicated (Component Network).
Prefab gameCannonShell
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer gemsGlow
		Node Diamond
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.6 0.95 1
		Emissive 15.9
		Scale 0.26
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Layer Projectile
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 0.35
		Density 140
		Restitution 0.1
		ContactEvents true
	Component Light
		Light Point
			Color 0.6 0.95 1
			Intensity 50
			Range 8
	Component Network
	Component GameProjectile
		UnitDamage 35
		StructureDamage 0
		Lifetime 8
		EmitterDrain 0
		EmitterDrainRadius 0
		SplashRadius 4
		SplashEdge 0.15
		HitsShadows true
		ImpactPuff true
		MuzzleFlash true
		FieldDeflect 10
		DeflectDrain 40
